{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42220","headline":"表弟包颍见寄 · 徐铉","name":"表弟包颍见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"常思帝里奉交亲，别後光阴屈指频。\n兰佩却归纶阁下，荆枝犹寄楚江滨。\n十程山水劳幽梦，满院烟花醉别人。\n料得此生强健在，会须重赏昔年春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42220.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42220","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}